 "salt": "TnTq-TEFtA5DyqRhF0WMrA==",
 "text": "Gwydion ab Dôn was a Welsh hero and the son of the mother goddess Dôn. He is central to the Mabinogion yet secondary to his brother Gilfaethwy, his uncle Math, and his sister Arianrhod. When Gilfaethwy lusted after Goewin, Gwydion helped him rape her, so Math turned both brothers into deer, pigs, and wolves. He later tricked Arianrhod into naming his son Lleu Llaw Gyffes and shaped Blodeuwedd from flowers as Lleu's bride. She became a murderess, Lleu turned into an eagle, and Gwydion restored him and made her an owl. Some call him a shrunken version of an earlier sky god who ruled the stars and Annwn.",
